WEBVTT

00:10.440 --> 00:12.200
(The 34th year of Hongye.)

00:12.400 --> 00:13.920
(Emperor Xing has passed away.)

00:14.240 --> 00:15.890
(The deposed Crown Prince
Nangong Xuanyu)

00:16.200 --> 00:18.040
(slaughtered the six princes
with swift force)

00:18.260 --> 00:19.760
(and purged the traitorous officials)

00:20.000 --> 00:21.380
(to ascend the throne as Emperor.)

00:22.120 --> 00:24.000
(Even though
the Emperor is a ruthless tyrant,)

00:24.000 --> 00:25.600
(who resembles an Asura,)

00:25.840 --> 00:29.160
(noble families still send
their daughters to the capital.)

00:29.440 --> 00:31.160
(Yet, to this day)

00:31.160 --> 00:33.360
(no one has won his favor.)

00:37.040 --> 00:40.200
(Summon the candidates to the palace!)

00:44.310 --> 00:46.190
(I am the concubine-born
daughter of the Shen family,)

00:46.200 --> 00:47.480
(Shen Zhinian.)

00:48.120 --> 00:50.960
(In my past life,
I married the poor scholar Lu Jianglin)

00:51.200 --> 00:53.160
(and helped him
become the Prime Minister.)

00:53.620 --> 00:55.510
(My legitimate elder sister
entered the palace selection)

00:55.520 --> 00:57.050
(but ended up as a discarded consort.)

00:57.720 --> 00:58.880
(In this life,)

00:59.000 --> 01:01.360
(my sister, who once cried
and pleaded to enter the palace)

01:01.600 --> 01:02.800
(actually changed her mind.)

01:03.120 --> 01:04.160
Father, Mother,

01:04.300 --> 01:05.510
I'm not going to the palace.

01:05.880 --> 01:07.120
I want to marry Lu Jianglin.

01:07.240 --> 01:08.600
Entering the palace is a dead end.

01:08.880 --> 01:10.000
Let Shen Zhinian go instead.

01:17.480 --> 01:18.680
Shen Zhinian,

01:19.400 --> 01:20.960
you'd better hold onto

01:21.160 --> 01:22.480
this fortune.

01:22.920 --> 01:24.000
This harem

01:24.240 --> 01:25.760
is quite "exciting".

01:33.520 --> 01:34.780
(But she doesn't know)

01:35.520 --> 01:36.880
(that Lu Jianglin)

01:36.880 --> 01:38.240
(is an ungrateful man)

01:38.240 --> 01:39.980
(who killed his own wife
with his own hands.)

01:42.600 --> 01:43.640
(Living this life again,)

01:44.580 --> 01:46.160
(rather than helping others to the top,)

01:46.760 --> 01:48.440
(I would rather hold the power myself.)

01:49.100 --> 01:51.120
(I will marry the most
powerful man in the world.)

01:51.880 --> 01:53.240
(I'll use him as a stepping stone)

01:53.420 --> 01:54.740
(to soar to the highest heights.)

01:54.740 --> 01:57.540
=Daughter of Fortune=

01:57.540 --> 01:58.940
(Adapted from the novel
"Phoenix Palace Dream")

01:58.940 --> 02:00.140
(Author: Lan Jiujiu)

02:00.220 --> 02:03.140
=Episode 1=

02:03.480 --> 02:04.640
The flowers you hold

02:04.640 --> 02:06.080
were all chosen by yourselves.

02:06.480 --> 02:08.320
Be sure to hold onto them tightly.

02:08.600 --> 02:09.920
If the flower falls,

02:10.080 --> 02:11.680
(Shen Zhinian)
you are disqualified.

02:11.680 --> 02:13.020
(Concubine-born daughter
of the Shen family in Chizhou)

02:15.540 --> 02:19.220
(Xu Baoqin,
daughter of the Xu family army)

02:21.980 --> 02:25.500
(Liu Ruyan,
relative of Dowager Consort Liu)

02:28.200 --> 02:29.920
You actually chose a Yulan magnolia.

02:30.200 --> 02:31.640
How unlucky.

02:32.240 --> 02:33.600
Well, I am different.

02:34.000 --> 02:34.760
What I chose

02:34.920 --> 02:36.000
is a Rhododendron.

02:36.480 --> 02:37.880
His Majesty loves vibrant colors.

02:38.360 --> 02:39.440
The Rhododendron is vibrant.

02:39.760 --> 02:41.160
I will be selected.

02:41.720 --> 02:43.040
The Rhododendron "cries blood".

02:43.480 --> 02:44.520
It's an ill omen.

02:45.840 --> 02:47.080
Shen Zhinian,

02:47.280 --> 02:48.840
how dare you curse me!

02:49.360 --> 02:50.920
I am the daughter of a Great General.

02:50.920 --> 02:52.120
What do you think you are?

02:52.120 --> 02:53.600
You two, please stop arguing.

02:53.720 --> 02:56.040
Baoqin is innocent and lively.

02:56.160 --> 02:58.360
Sister Zhinian is
exceptionally beautiful.

02:58.840 --> 03:00.600
I'm sure you will
both make it to the end.

03:01.080 --> 03:02.120
Are you trying to say

03:02.280 --> 03:03.400
that I'm not beautiful?

03:05.520 --> 03:07.280
Everyone says

03:07.760 --> 03:09.440
that Shen Zhinian of Chizhou

03:10.080 --> 03:11.360
is the top beauty.

03:13.760 --> 03:15.040
(Liu Ruyan is trying to make me)

03:15.040 --> 03:16.400
(a target for everyone else.)

03:22.440 --> 03:23.600
Drag them all away.

03:24.720 --> 03:25.880
Have mercy, Your Majesty!

03:26.320 --> 03:28.200
Please give me another chance,
Your Majesty!

03:28.520 --> 03:29.360
Your Majesty.

03:29.390 --> 03:31.280
The backgrounds of
these candidates are complex.

03:31.720 --> 03:32.600
Duke Zhen,

03:32.760 --> 03:33.600
Duke Ding,

03:33.760 --> 03:34.660
and the Princess Manor

03:34.720 --> 03:35.960
have all planted their people.

03:36.140 --> 03:38.560
(Nangong Xuanyu, Emperor of Daliang)

03:38.560 --> 03:40.680
Since they've arranged
everything for me,

03:41.400 --> 03:42.520
let them stand there

03:43.240 --> 03:44.880
until I finish this game of weiqi.

03:45.480 --> 03:47.160
Treating noble daughters
like weiqi pieces

03:47.400 --> 03:48.660
and leaving them out in the sun

03:48.960 --> 03:50.400
might be hard to justify.

03:50.400 --> 03:51.520
Justify?

03:52.120 --> 03:53.520
When they sent these people,

03:53.920 --> 03:55.840
did they ever try to justify it to me?

03:59.110 --> 04:01.080
(This isn't about
testing our endurance at all.)

04:02.760 --> 04:04.360
(Why does he have each of us standing)

04:04.360 --> 04:05.560
(in a specific spot?)

04:07.960 --> 04:10.240
(He is treating us like weiqi pieces.)

04:20.400 --> 04:22.240
(This is a stalemate.)

04:26.880 --> 04:28.920
(No. 1 Beauty of Chizhou?)

04:29.120 --> 04:31.440
(I'm going to turn her into
the No. 1 Cripple of Chizhou.)

04:33.760 --> 04:36.000
(He placed us here as discarded pawns.)

04:36.560 --> 04:38.000
(He cannot solve this game.)

04:38.240 --> 04:40.440
(We will be stuck here forever.)

04:42.600 --> 04:43.920
(This is an ancient endgame.)

04:44.110 --> 04:44.840
(It's unsolvable.)

04:45.400 --> 04:46.880
(If you want to break the deadlock,)

04:46.920 --> 04:48.000
(there is only one way.)

04:48.840 --> 04:49.960
(Clear the board.)

04:50.440 --> 04:51.160
(Start over.)

04:51.160 --> 04:52.270
Shen Zhinian, what are you doing?

04:52.280 --> 04:53.440
Shen Zhinian,
what do you think you're doing?

04:53.440 --> 04:54.680
Shen Zhinian of Chizhou,

04:54.840 --> 04:55.600
failed.

04:56.280 --> 04:57.320
Take her away.

04:58.480 --> 05:00.320
(She actually saw the solution.)

05:00.480 --> 05:01.520
(Interesting.)

05:06.180 --> 05:08.400
This is the Emperor's
Golden Feather Arrow for the selection.

05:08.400 --> 05:09.900
Why did he choose her of all people?

05:12.440 --> 05:13.680
By imperial decree,

05:13.680 --> 05:16.000
Shen Zhinian of Chizhou

05:16.000 --> 05:17.480
is titled Senior Attendant Rou.

05:17.800 --> 05:19.880
She is granted
residence in Tinglan Palace.

05:20.760 --> 05:23.280
- Congratulations, Senior Attendant Rou.
- Congratulations, Senior Attendant Rou.

05:23.280 --> 05:24.520
I thank His Majesty.

05:28.120 --> 05:29.560
(I gambled correctly.)

05:30.440 --> 05:32.080
(Receiving a title
so unexpectedly today)

05:32.500 --> 05:34.760
(will surely incite jealousy
among the other candidates.)

05:35.400 --> 05:36.680
(From now on, in the palace,)

05:36.900 --> 05:38.100
(I must be even more careful.)

05:38.100 --> 05:39.260
(Cold Palace)

05:42.280 --> 05:44.080
Please bear it a moment longer,
Your Majesty.

05:44.090 --> 05:45.890
The White Snake
treatment is almost finished.

05:46.610 --> 05:47.520
However, Your Majesty,

05:47.620 --> 05:49.470
the backlash of the poison
is becoming more dangerous.

05:49.480 --> 05:51.520
If this continues,
the consequences will be bad.

05:53.240 --> 05:54.440
Manshu Tears.

05:55.010 --> 05:56.680
Flowers bloom,
but leaves never see them.

05:57.400 --> 05:58.960
Like entering a realm of ice and fire.

05:59.280 --> 06:00.600
First ice, then fire.

06:01.120 --> 06:02.720
It flares up once a month.

06:03.520 --> 06:05.200
I actually quite like it.

06:07.660 --> 06:09.160
It's thanks to Dowager Concubine Qin,

06:09.160 --> 06:10.560
who built this secret room
for your treatment

06:10.560 --> 06:11.600
here in the Cold Palace.

06:12.000 --> 06:14.160
Otherwise, every full moon
when the poison flares up,

06:14.400 --> 06:16.400
(Wen Ling, Imperial Guard)
the Duke Zhen would notice something.

06:17.920 --> 06:19.080
Focus on the main task.

06:19.500 --> 06:21.280
The matter regarding
the Chifeng Army token

06:21.800 --> 06:22.880
must be handled quickly.

06:23.480 --> 06:24.560
Understood, Your Majesty.

06:29.240 --> 06:31.160
Shen Zhinian of Chizhou

06:32.000 --> 06:34.000
could solve a stalemate.

06:35.800 --> 06:37.520
Interesting.

06:37.900 --> 06:39.280
(Tinglan Palace)

06:39.280 --> 06:39.920
Young Lady,

06:40.040 --> 06:41.120
I've made inquiries.

06:41.200 --> 06:43.150
There is indeed a eunuch
named Li Congshan in the Cold Palace.

06:43.160 --> 06:44.200
(Handan, Shen Zhinian's Maid)
He is on duty tonight.

06:45.520 --> 06:46.800
As long as he exists, it's fine.

06:47.320 --> 06:48.280
Bring me my cloak.

06:48.400 --> 06:49.580
I'm going to the Cold Palace.

06:50.960 --> 06:52.600
Young Lady, why are you looking for him?

06:52.880 --> 06:54.990
His Majesty hasn't visited
the harem for a long time.

06:55.160 --> 06:56.210
If I want to win his favor,

06:56.320 --> 06:57.440
I must find another way.

06:58.120 --> 07:00.400
Li Congshan used to be the Emperor's
personal attendant.

07:00.460 --> 07:01.960
Because he offended a favored consort,

07:02.310 --> 07:04.100
he was banished to work
in the Cold Palace.

07:04.520 --> 07:06.720
He knows a lot about
the Emperor's preferences in bed.

07:07.160 --> 07:08.400
I'm going to consult him.

07:09.080 --> 07:10.680
Preferences in bed?

07:11.120 --> 07:13.660
There are as many as 30 beauties
entering the palace this time.

07:13.800 --> 07:15.360
Yet he only gave me a title.

07:15.640 --> 07:17.600
I don't know what he sees in me.

07:18.960 --> 07:20.560
He might summon me to serve at any time.

07:20.960 --> 07:22.240
I must make sure

07:22.250 --> 07:24.230
he remembers me vividly
from the very first night.

07:24.240 --> 07:26.760
Young Lady, how did you become so bold?

07:27.680 --> 07:29.440
Only the bold can carve out a future.

07:29.660 --> 07:31.880
People don't always get
a second chance to start over.

07:32.800 --> 07:33.680
Whitey,

07:33.680 --> 07:34.600
help cover for me.

07:34.610 --> 07:36.680
Then, remember to take
the east side gate, Young Lady.

07:36.680 --> 07:37.900
The area is unguarded.

07:37.900 --> 07:40.020
(Cold Palace)

07:58.120 --> 07:59.440
Go ahead.

08:16.520 --> 08:18.440
(How is there no one
in the Cold Palace?)

08:19.320 --> 08:21.000
Didn't they say the concubines

08:21.000 --> 08:22.520
sent here were too many to fit?

08:25.120 --> 08:26.160
Whitey.

08:27.200 --> 08:28.000
Whitey,

08:28.360 --> 08:29.240
don't run off.

08:29.440 --> 08:30.680
Careful, or you'll be stewed.

08:43.440 --> 08:44.320
You are...

08:49.040 --> 08:50.120
Who are you?

08:50.420 --> 08:51.400
What are you doing here?

08:51.720 --> 08:53.280
I'm looking for my cat.

08:53.560 --> 08:54.480
I mean no harm.

08:54.560 --> 08:55.200
Really.

09:04.380 --> 09:06.460
(Attendant)

09:08.080 --> 09:09.120
Are you...

09:11.240 --> 09:12.400
Are you Attendant Li?

09:15.640 --> 09:16.880
Why are you looking for him?

09:18.040 --> 09:19.520
Actually, I came to find Attendant Li

09:19.520 --> 09:20.440
to buy something.

09:21.390 --> 09:22.640
I'm willing to pay handsomely.

09:23.680 --> 09:24.720
Buy what?

09:27.720 --> 09:28.920
The art of seduction.

09:31.880 --> 09:33.080
I wonder

09:33.440 --> 09:34.840
where you plan

09:35.240 --> 09:36.600
to use this art.

09:37.110 --> 09:38.700
No need to ask questions, Attendant Li.

09:39.040 --> 09:40.000
Just name your price.

09:41.480 --> 09:42.720
Since you've found me,

09:43.200 --> 09:44.880
you must follow my rules.

09:45.720 --> 09:46.560
What rules?

09:47.080 --> 09:48.280
The rule of inspection.

09:48.440 --> 09:49.280
(Inspection?)

09:49.480 --> 09:50.360
I must check

09:50.760 --> 09:51.960
if your hands are soft enough.

09:52.920 --> 09:53.960
(No internal power.)

09:55.280 --> 09:56.120
I also must check

09:56.360 --> 09:57.680
if your waist is flexible enough.

10:00.160 --> 10:01.560
(No hidden weapons.)

10:03.100 --> 10:04.500
Are you done with your inspection?

10:04.840 --> 10:05.920
It's my turn to inspect you.

10:28.360 --> 10:29.280
Shen Zhinian,

10:29.840 --> 10:30.720
it's been so long.

10:30.840 --> 10:32.400
Is the Emperor's portrait restored?

10:32.660 --> 10:33.520
Bring it here quickly.

10:36.860 --> 10:42.780
♪Falling at first sight,
a life of turmoil wasted♪

10:43.540 --> 10:50.140
♪Dim lamps, concerns unheard by anyone♪

10:51.240 --> 10:52.440
(Nangong Xuanyu?)

10:53.020 --> 10:56.460
♪All the spring colors
lean toward one person♪

10:57.040 --> 10:59.200
You seem quite curious
about my appearance, Young Lady.

10:59.320 --> 11:01.400
(Rumor says Nangong Xuanyu
killed his father and brothers.)

11:01.400 --> 11:02.720
(He is prone to distrust.)

11:03.200 --> 11:04.480
(I can't let him realize)

11:04.600 --> 11:05.640
(that I've recognized him.)

11:07.880 --> 11:10.120
Attendant Li,
you won't even show your true face.

11:10.480 --> 11:11.240
I'm not doing

11:11.660 --> 11:12.360
this deal anymore.

11:12.840 --> 11:13.440
Let go of me.

11:13.600 --> 11:14.160
Madam,

11:14.320 --> 11:15.040
this way.

11:20.240 --> 11:21.200
What should you do?

11:21.960 --> 11:23.240
You can't get away now, can you?

11:35.080 --> 11:40.170
♪Broken dreams,
listening to the light rain♪

11:41.910 --> 11:47.140
♪Bitter cold, bringing mist to the eyes♪

11:48.780 --> 11:51.140
♪If we don't meet♪

11:51.360 --> 11:54.580
♪Flowers bloom and fall in shame♪

11:54.770 --> 12:01.320
♪If we meet again,
the peaches will be warm♪

12:01.650 --> 12:08.100
♪Spring breeze passes,
dancing through the years♪

12:08.450 --> 12:14.770
♪Brewing longing,
remembering past lives♪

12:15.290 --> 12:21.980
♪Hard to meet, and just as hard to part♪

12:21.980 --> 12:28.860
♪Who planted the beans
that grew into lotuses?♪

12:29.100 --> 12:34.980
♪Spring breeze passes,
composing the fleeting years♪

12:35.890 --> 12:42.510
♪Clouds on Mount Wu,
no sails on the sea♪

12:42.680 --> 12:49.350
♪Wanting to fold
my heart into a paper kite♪

12:49.620 --> 12:56.050
♪But the ties are too tangled to sever♪
